  "details": "Replace the word \"players\" of the following with \"users\":\n\n- 34574 `Remote Players` The personal mirror on/off option in the Action Menu \n\n- 97334 `Show Other Players`  The option name on MM > Settings > Mirrors > Personal Mirror\n\n- 97328 `When enabled, your personal mirror will reflect other players.`  Tooltip of 97334\n\n  \n\nCf. Aev said on the Localization server\n\n> Generally, the preferred term should always be \"user\".\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1103375971719057519/1113670859899551805",
